  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The vision for Delivering as One in Mozambique is of a unified United Nations presence, which speaks, acts, and delivers as one. The overall goal of Delivering as One in Mozambique is to ensure the delivery of concrete results in support of the national development objectives and priorities by a more coherent, better coordinated, funded and managed UN</narrative>
  </description>
